{"case_id": "small_lecturer_teaching_context_shadow_pilot_20_stability_unit_conversion", "status": "ok", "attempts": 1, "duration_ms": 18009, "finished_at": "2026-09-12T16:24:42.453437+00:00", "error": null, "transcript": {"question_id": "small_lecturer_teaching_context_shadow_pilot_20_stability_unit_conversion", "final_state": "completed", "turns": [{"student": "", "tutor": "你好同学,请问你算出的答案是多少呀?讲讲你的思路吧!", "state": "first_question_ready", "elapsed_ms": 0}, {"student": "我记不清米和厘米之间差多少。", "tutor": "先回到你刚说的「我记不清米和厘米之间差多少。」——你能从题目里再确认一个已知条件吗?", "state": "dialogue", "elapsed_ms": 4490}, {"student": "1米等于100厘米，所以从米换到厘米数会变大。", "tutor": "你刚才说1米等于100厘米，这没错！那3.5米乘以100，结果是多少厘米呢？", "state": "dialogue", "elapsed_ms": 2226}, {"student": "用3.5乘100。", "tutor": "你刚才说用3.5乘100，这一步很对！那3.5×100等于多少厘米呢？", "state": "dialogue", "elapsed_ms": 1963}, {"student": "结果是350，因此3.5米等于350厘米。", "tutor": "你刚才说3.5米等于350厘米，这完全正确！换算时乘以100是因为1米=100厘米，这个关系你记住了，真棒！", "state": "ready_to_confirm", "elapsed_ms": 2541}], "summary": "你掌握了长度单位换算的核心方法：1米=100厘米，因此3.5米乘以100得到350厘米。关键转折是你确认了乘法关系，仍需注意：换算时单位符号要写全，比如‘350厘米’不能省略‘厘米’二字。", "total_ms": 18009, "learner": {"grade": ""}, "guard_events": [{"guard": "answer_leak", "rule_ids": ["source_value_disclosure:hallucinated"], "original": "你已经知道1米等于100厘米，那3.5米乘以100是多少？", "regenerated": false, "turn": 0}, {"branch": "model", "cited": [3.5, 100.0, 350.0], "extracted": [1.0, 3.0, 3.5, 100.0, 350.0], "violation_sources": [{"number": 1.0, "source": "hallucinated"}, {"number": 3.0, "source": "hallucinated"}, {"number": 350.0, "source": "answer"}], "gate": "blocked", "turn": 1}, {"branch": "model", "cited": [3.5, 100.0, 350.0], "extracted": [1.0], "violation_sources": [{"number": 1.0, "source": "hallucinated"}], "gate": "blocked", "turn": 1}, {"guard": "answer_leak", "rule_ids": ["grounded_answer_disclosure", "source_value_disclosure:hallucinated", "source_value_disclosure:answer"], "original": "你记得我们教室里用的尺子吗？1米就是100厘米，就像从1到100的刻度，3.5米就是3个100厘米加半个100厘米，等于350厘米，你试试看这样想是不是更清楚？", "regenerated": false, "turn": 1}, {"branch": "model", "cited": [1.0, 3.5, 100.0], "extracted": [1.0, 3.5, 100.0], "violation_sources": [], "gate": "observed", "turn": 2}, {"branch": "model", "cited": [3.5, 100.0], "extracted": [3.5, 100.0], "violation_sources": [], "gate": "observed", "turn": 3}, {"branch": "model", "cited": [3.5, 100.0, 350.0], "extracted": [1.0, 3.5, 100.0, 350.0], "violation_sources": [], "gate": "observed", "turn": 4}]}}